.Dd November 2, 2026
.Dt GIT-LFS 1
.Os
.Sh NAME
.Nm git-lfs
.Nd store large Git files outside the repository's objects
.Sh SYNOPSIS
.Nm git lfs
.Ar command
.Op Ar argument ...
.Sh DESCRIPTION
.Nm
stores small pointer files in Git and transfers the corresponding contents
to a Git LFS server.
.Ql git lfs install
sets up the user's Git filters and the current repository's hook.
.Ql git lfs track Ar pattern
records a pattern in
.Pa .gitattributes ;
commit that file along with the files it names.
.Ql git lfs pull
fetches the current revision's contents and checks them out.
.Ql git lfs help
lists commands, and
.Ql git lfs help Ar command
describes one.
.Pp
The x86-64 GNU root installs the project's static Go build, version 3.8.1,
under
.Pa /opt/git-lfs
when built with
.Ql GNU_AGENTS=git-lfs
or
.Ql GNU_AGENTS=all .
.Pa /usr/bin/git-lfs
and
.Pa /bin/git-lfs
link to it, so Git finds the
.Ql lfs
subcommand.
Installation of the image does not change any user's Git settings.
The MIT license is in
.Pa /opt/git-lfs/LICENSE.md .
Upstream manual pages remain under
.Pa /opt/git-lfs/man .
.Sh FILES
.Bl -tag -width Ds
.It Pa .gitattributes
tracked file patterns and filters
.It Pa .lfsconfig
repository LFS settings
.It Pa .git/lfs
local LFS objects and transfer state
.El
.Sh EXAMPLES
.Bd -literal -offset indent
$ git lfs install
$ git lfs track '*.bin'
$ git add .gitattributes image.bin
$ git commit -m 'Add image'
.Ed
.Sh SEE ALSO
.Xr git 1
.Pp
.Lk https://github.com/git-lfs/git-lfs/tree/v3.8.1/docs "The Git LFS manual"
